[Submission1.Objectives]
Hold and defend the area specified.
[Submission1.Description]
The British XXX Corps has launched a new offensive against the 901 Panzergrenadier Regiment which is defending the town of Tilly.
 
Your orders:
- Hold the town
[Submission1.Success]
Well done Commander!
[Submission1.Failed]
Mission failed! Your troops have been destroyed.
[Submission2.Objectives]
Halt the enemy attack.
[Submission2.Description]
The British XXX Corps has launched a spoiling attack in order to disrupt your positions and allow their 7th Armoured Division to resume their own offensive.
 
Your orders:
- Halt the enemy attack.
[Submission2.Success]
Well done Commander! The enemy attack has been stopped.
[Submission2.Failed]
Mission failed! Your troops have been destroyed.